<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Adaptive Stochastic Coefficients for Accelerating Diffusion Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Proofs of Main Theoretical Results</span></a>
